PPMd variant H (Ppmd7*), as distributed in the LZMA SDK
=========================================================

Public domain.

From the source headers (Ppmd7.c, Ppmd7aDec.c, Ppmd7Dec.c, Ppmd7Enc.c):

    2023-09-07 : Igor Pavlov : Public domain
    This code is based on PPMd var.H (2001): Dmitry Shkarin : Public domain

Vendored unmodified from the 7-Zip / LZMA SDK (https://www.7-zip.org/sdk.html)
for use as one of this project's general-purpose stream coders
(`include/coders_pgrc.h`), selected automatically per stream by
`best_encode` when it produces the smallest result — see
`paper/ARCHITECTURE.md` §3.

Added for consistency with `thirdparty/fse/LICENSE` and
`thirdparty/htscodecs/LICENSE.md`, which document the same fact for this
project's other two vendored dependencies: no code in `thirdparty/` is
included without its licensing being stated in its own directory, not only
inline in a header comment.
